        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Depending on the needs of our advertisers, we may provide advices and services on advertising strategies and ad optimization, generally covering:",
        "start_character": 43981,
        "end_character": 44126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053161",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053161-1607b8866ce0d8b4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, we have been engaged by advertising agencies from time to time for placement of ads with media for which we are authorized agency, and we treat these advertising agencies and our direct advertisers alike in terms of the services we offer.",
        "start_character": 43116,
        "end_character": 43368
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053161",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053161-1607b8866ce0d8b4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "It should be noted that the above credit periods are primarily applicable to payments we make on behalf of our advertisers to media (or their authorized agencies and other service providers) for acquisition of their advertising services and ad inventory.",
        "start_character": 35253,
        "end_character": 35507
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053161",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053161-1607b8866ce0d8b4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To become the authorized agency of a media, we are typically subject to two to three rounds of evaluation by the media, during which the media takes into account factors including, but not limited to, the history of our Company, the size of our Company, our achievements, our service offerings, the advertisers we cooperate with, the history of our revenue, and the expertise of our employees.",
        "start_character": 14289,
        "end_character": 14682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053161",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053161-1607b8866ce0d8b4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our net fees revenue model, we are rewarded for our services provided to advertisers, which typically include, among other things, sourcing and procurement of ad inventory and advertising services on behalf of our advertisers with costs incurred in connection thereto.",
        "start_character": 31164,
        "end_character": 31438
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053161",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053161-1607b8866ce0d8b4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053161",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We advise advertisers on online marketing strategies, offer value-added advertising optimization services and facilitate the deployment of online ads of various forms such as search ads, in-feed ads, mobile app ads and social media marketing ads.",
